// 本文件源码取自同一游戏的源码版（033-2 longyunmeng），用 v22pre11 编译器重新编译，与本版的 .b 二进制完全一致。
// Source taken from the source edition of this game (033-2); it compiles to the same program as this edition's .b binary.
// dizi.c 五毒教弟子

inherit NPC;

void create()
{
	set_name("五毒教弟子", ({ "di zi", "dizi" }));
	set("age", 28);
	set("gender", "男性");
	set("long", "一个身体强壮的苗族青年，看来武功已小由所成。\n");
	set("attitude", "peaceful");
	set("max_qi", 500);

	set("str", 24);
	set("dex", 26);
	set("combat_exp", 100000);
	set("shen_type", -1);

	set_skill("unarmed", 40);
	set_skill("dodge", 40);
	set_skill("parry", 40);
	set_skill("sword", 40);
	set_skill("force", 40);
	set_temp("apply/attack", 40);
	set_temp("apply/defense", 40);
	set_temp("apply/damage", 20);
	set_temp("apply/armor", 40);

	setup();
	carry_object(__DIR__"obj/ganggou")->wield();
	carry_object(__DIR__"obj/jinyi")->wear();
}

